140 tan card, 888×1212 artboard, and full-bleed framing as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub macOS runner evidence bound to this head."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityActivationPoint(_:)-9b1b9":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityactivationpoint(_:)-9b1b9","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityActivationPoint(_:)-9b1b9","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityActivationPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind"